==History==
2019
*The Goblin Cage was once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Goblin Cage Draft Challenge]], which started on 17/5/2019. In this [[Tournament|challenge]], gameplay was similar to a regular Draft Challenge, except that one of the players was able to choose who would use the Goblin Cage. If the player achieved at least 10 wins, they obtained the Goblin Cage early.
*From 25/5/2019 through 28/5/2019, the [[Shop]] had a special offer where [[Arenas|Arena]] 12+ players could buy up to 3 special Fortune [[Chests]] at the normal price that guarantee at least 66% of the Chest's contents to be Goblin Cage. The Chest was able to generate up to 150% of its contents to be Goblin Cage.
*The Goblin Cage [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 4/6/2019.
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July%202019%20Update%20(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]], increased the Goblin Cage's lifetime to 20 seconds (from 15 seconds), increased the damage of the Goblin Brawler by 25%, and increased the Goblin Brawler's range to 0.8 tiles (from 0.75 tiles), now classified as Melee: Short. His description was also updated; previously saying "''When the Goblin Cage is destroyed, a Goblin Brawler is unleashed into the Arena! Goblin Brawler never skips leg day.''" It also added the Goblin Cage as a [[Trophies|Trophy Road]] reward.
*On 2/9/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/9/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Brawler's speed to 90 (from 120), now classified as Fast.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Goblin Cage's card info screen.
2020
*On 5/5/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/5/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Brawler's damage by 6%.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Goblin Cage from Spooky Town to Goblin Stadium.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
*On 7/12/2021, the [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2021)|2021 Quarter 4 Update]], decreased Goblin Cage's hitpoints by 23%.
2022
*On 30/3/2022, the [[Version History#Miner%20Update%20(30/3/2022)|Miner Update]], made the Goblin Cage's rattling visual effect apply all the time. Previously it would only rattle when an enemy ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] is nearby.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 3/10/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/10/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Brawler's hitpoints by 5.2%.
2024
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], increased the Goblin Cage’s hitpoints by 5.1%. It also added the Goblin Cage to the Goblin class.
*On 5/8/2024, the [[Version History|August 2024 Update]], added the Goblin Cage’s Evolution.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Goblin Brawler's hitpoints by 0.09%.

